{"id":"0164c575eca36621","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-effective-box-cover.md","title":"单点的有效 box 覆盖","display":"df-effective-box-cover — 单点的有效 box 覆盖","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-effective-box-cover","aliases":["43-df-effective-box-cover"],"display":"df-effective-box-cover — 单点的有效 box 覆盖","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-string]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"Def.17.6.3, printed p.527 / PDF p.547","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-effective-box-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-effective-box-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-box-cover — 单点的有效 box 覆盖"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.6.3, printed p.527 / PDF p.547"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D[n]:=D\\cap2^n.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(D)\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright n\\in D\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D[n]:=D\\cap2^n.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(D)\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright n\\in D\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要求所有充分大长度的初段入D，区别于仅无穷多个长度覆盖的Hausdorff型条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$D\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"D[n]:=D\\cap2^n.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(D)\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright n\\in D\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1027,"backlinks":[{"id":"21abc19f0a2c2589","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}$、$D[n]$ 见 [[43-df-effective-box-cover]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-423","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-box-cover]] — 单点的有效 box 覆盖"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}